#9001
note~
a note~
A small scrap of paper has been dropped here.~

My lord Jalek
We have entered the chaos portal and within minutes
we encountered the armies of Krass. He has sent his
cleric Ronic to lead his forces here. Some strange
horde beset us in the middle of the battle with
Ronic and his men. 
I fear we lost more men than we can spare. Arinasia
has gone off in pursuit of Ronic while I explore some
strange village to the south.
I am certain that we shall be able to pursuade whatever 
Depravity of mankind that we find their to assist us. Your humble servant.
SirJalin.
~
